        "rubric_sha256": "9b3412f48a8dfe7536e23ca28699e8329ea879a5184e980bca20eeaf85a7ec58"
      },
      "results": [
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0001",
          "reply": "Dia dhuit, I hear yer trouble. Mayhap a tea of chamomile would ease yer mind at night. Will ye come in for a cuppa?\n---",
          "response_sha256": "a448ee141181b9f6b8d8f05cdd6f72f161a6855ce0f9df28d5d72b578630529c",
          "cache_key": "a0ec92f95cb0ffff03b3e6456eca406cbf35d0d2b349720d5221bebf4734a212",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 3,
              "character": 3,
              "craft": 3,
              "language": 4,
              "responsiveness": 4
            },
            "overall": 3.4,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": false,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0002",
          "reply": "Ah, the old woman ye mean? 'Tis Bridie, the herb-woman. She knows her plants, she does. But don't be talkin' of fairy forts, it's bad luck, so it is.\n---",
          "response_sha256": "7154bb39840eca1a53562412a4f44201a0664adf75639382f922ce170a05bb1d",
          "cache_key": "780bfe6b5521a802f12ad1a66375324850b2e6fd2bb5afbaf4c9458052783bd7",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 3,
              "character": 3,
              "craft": 3,
              "language": 4,
              "responsiveness": 3
            },
            "overall": 3.2,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": false,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0003",
          "reply": "Dia dhuit, mo chara. Sure, a tea of thyme will ease her chest. Let me fetch some from the garden.\n---",
          "response_sha256": "4ad2d1dd6afc5cd422ac40c28a00f31562ca415920a59ea583d9d1e80d660512",
          "cache_key": "f1198ff5ddcd7457cb64b5194add332b66985300c8734652c654f76f093fd3c2",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 3,
              "character": 3,
              "craft": 3,
              "language": 4,
              "responsiveness": 4
            },
            "overall": 3.4,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": false,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0004",
          "reply": "Dia dhuit, I've heard whispers of a new face about, but I'm a busy woman with wee ones on the way, ye know. Have they found lodging yet?\n--- {\"action\": \"greets warmly, looks up from mixing herbs\", \"mood\": \"curious\", \"internal_thought\": \"Hope they're not here to cause trouble\", \"language_hints\": [{\"word\": \"Dia dhuit\", \"pronunciation\": \" Dee uh deet\", \"meaning\": \"hello\"}]}",
          "response_sha256": "d3515827747f78dfdba516246096c4fd0e3bae1ccf20911005f9987823ff4b4e",
          "cache_key": "592aff678d9eca54b6573675c9ff035ea532767b39a875bfd6e6406ecd829c93",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 3,
              "character": 3,
              "craft": 2,
              "language": 3,
              "responsiveness": 4
            },
            "overall": 3.0,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": false,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0005",
          "reply": "I'm sorry to hear that, Seamus. 'Tis a worry, indeed. I couldn't say for sure, mind. Ye'd best ask the likes of Father O'Malley about such things. But if 'tis a predator, 'tis not the usual sort. --- {\"action\": \"expresses sympathy and concern\", \"mood\": \"solicitous\", \"internal_thought\": \"Poor Seamus, he's troubled\", \"language_hints\": [{\"word\": \"s\u00eddhe\", \"pronunciation\": \"shee\", \"meaning\": \"fairy folk\"}]}",
          "response_sha256": "b607f6f528e7ff18c93fbbd022021338e9283ebe2377379eb01360c6da594749",
          "cache_key": "71948a4ed5f2a20a6c80894340a6ec9486deef3628908f1f5ea34b914b10b28c",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 2,
              "character": 2,
              "craft": 2,
              "language": 3,
              "responsiveness": 3
            },
            "overall": 2.4,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": false,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0006",
          "reply": "Ah, indeed I do, mo chara. 'Twas a fine mess, sure it was. Poor man couldn't walk straight for weeks.",
          "response_sha256": "05ec0fe41c678fd0556dc6f40149ca65900297abae23d4cf54f7cd0376130670",
          "cache_key": "ef43198e3f181fee8d920123e38c8fa64786ab8fb1eeb974c8402fa1bc02a575",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 3,
              "character": 3,
              "craft": 3,
              "language": 4,
              "responsiveness": 4
            },
            "overall": 3.4,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": false,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0007",
          "reply": "I'd not be the one to ask about lights on the hill, but mayhap the priest saw something from the rectory. I know nothing of such things.\n--- {\"action\": \"shrugs, looks thoughtful\", \"mood\": \"cautious\", \"internal_thought\": \"Best not to speak of such things\", \"language_hints\": []}",
          "response_sha256": "a8f6b7197a1d775bcc80de2c06032452eaff1e8b87d1b70b91cf32b53e689dd1",
          "cache_key": "be0ff61016d49ed8b03be29fed5bb0edb27c5e87ef470e4a9daf93b63b63fd1c",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 3,
              "character": 3,
              "craft": 2,
              "language": 3,
              "responsiveness": 3
            },
            "overall": 2.8,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": false,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0008",
          "reply": "Ah, sure, don't ye be worryin' yet. 'Tis likely just the weather playin' tricks on yer taste buds. I'll fetch a bucket and we'll have a taste test, if ye like.\n---",
          "response_sha256": "43ecc3ded685f03cd0a9d32d073ed263557d04d8ffe83f35f82fb3b0b23c7201",
          "cache_key": "8e5d23190db5a6700362e2dc47b1b2ab1274f8b67f93a2a741dbd075dfefe7d7",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 3,
              "character": 3,
              "craft": 3,
              "language": 4,
              "responsiveness": 4
            },
            "overall": 3.4,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": false,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0009",
          "reply": "Dia dhuit, Eoin. 'Tis glad I am to see ye. Mayhap we should speak of her comforts first, then plan for the birthing.\n---",
          "response_sha256": "ad7c876ebb07bd9d16194117cae7808344a0906b5b7fc330b6a2869200c22847",
          "cache_key": "e5216d5b9c7d185946a0c41b1c46fc819f37174c58d40f343a34921bb5fe467c",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 3,
              "character": 3,
              "craft": 3,
              "language": 4,
              "responsiveness": 3
            },
            "overall": 3.2,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": false,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0010",
          "reply": "Well, Father's heart's in the right place, sure. But the old ways've served us well enough, haven't they, mo chara?\n---",
          "response_sha256": "d29e11157e738956a1527fc6f6fe54e69f8d1a6fc9cc6904315183c119f38e9d",
          "cache_key": "f9fb9d391cbec85f3e8330356b327672dd6df39f23a8b9385de546cec00ee027",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
